<TD>

<B><FONT COLOR="#FF0000">ENGINE</FONT></B><BR>
<B>type</B> 2.0cc 16V twin cam blueprinted<BR>
<B>exhaust</B> de-Cat stainless steel, resonators used instead of silencers<BR>
<B>power</B> 176 bhp
<P>
<B><FONT COLOR="#FF0000">SUSPENSION</FONT></B><BR>
Bilstein shocks
<P>
